00:03:07,260 --> 00:03:16,260
It does not dislodge bad estrogens from the estrogen receptors, only the fermented soybeans will do that.

00:03:16,260 --> 00:03:30,260
So to answer your question is our fermented soybeans in the form of a food like NATO, a good food source for someone who has estrogen driven cancer, absolutely yes.

